==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Aquapolis|Aipom|67}} from the {{TCG|Aquapolis}} expansion.
*'''Tail Smash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Expedition|Charizard|39}} from the {{TCG|Expedition Base Set}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Ultra Moon}}.

